WEBVTT

00:00:01.590 --> 00:00:02.680
One day.

00:00:03.430 --> 00:00:04.390
Huh?

00:00:04.390 --> 00:00:04.970
It's gone...

00:00:04.970 --> 00:00:06.850
It's gone. It's gone!

00:00:07.070 --> 00:00:08.800
Did I drop it?

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.310
Sonya-chan!!

00:00:12.310 --> 00:00:15.020
Help me look for it!

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:18.330
My head...

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.390
Don't jump at me like that!

00:00:20.390 --> 00:00:22.400
So what did you lose?

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.490
Um...

00:00:24.490 --> 00:00:25.440
What was it again?

00:00:26.220 --> 00:00:28.490
You forgot what you lost?

00:00:28.490 --> 00:00:31.870
N-No! It's just not coming to mind!

00:00:31.870 --> 00:00:34.820
You hit my head so I lost focus...

00:00:34.820 --> 00:00:36.490
Fine, just calm down.

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:42.330
So, what were we talking about?

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:44.020
She forgot even more!

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:25.860
What should I do?

00:02:25.860 --> 00:02:28.480
I seriously can't remember what I lost!

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:31.570
If you forgot then it can't be important.

00:02:31.570 --> 00:02:35.190
You can totally forget about important things!

00:02:35.530 --> 00:02:37.360
Like where you put your purse,

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:39.350
or your pin number,

00:02:39.350 --> 00:02:41.820
or whether you locked the door on the way out...

00:02:41.970 --> 00:02:46.790
Maybe it was an important secret related to the destruction of the Earth!

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:48.900
Wasn't it something you lost?

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:54.080
I have no idea what it was, but you're an idiot for losing something so important.

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:55.810
I can't help it!

00:02:55.810 --> 00:02:58.030
You're the one who made me forget!

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:58.650
What now?!

00:02:59.840 --> 00:03:02.960
If you don't shut up, I'm going to test my new weapon on you.

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:04.710
Oh? What's that?

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:06.860
It's scary.

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:08.690
What's wrong?

00:03:08.690 --> 00:03:10.060
Don't tell me you lost it...

00:03:10.060 --> 00:03:11.060
No!

00:03:11.060 --> 00:03:12.710
I-It's this.

00:03:13.470 --> 00:03:14.870
Isn't that your usual knife?

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:19.090
It looks the same, but this one has an amazing trick...

00:03:19.090 --> 00:03:20.490
It uh...

00:03:20.490 --> 00:03:22.410
It shoots beams.

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:23.610
Wow! No way!

00:03:23.810 --> 00:03:25.040
Let me see! Let me see!

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:25.960
I want to try!

00:03:25.960 --> 00:03:27.370
This is for pros only!

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:29.830
Then at least show me the beam!

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:33.230
Come on, hurry up!

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:34.750
It shoots beams, right?

00:03:35.440 --> 00:03:37.750
Let's see it!

00:03:37.950 --> 00:03:38.970
Three!

00:03:38.970 --> 00:03:39.920
Two!

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:40.870
One!

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:43.830
The beam, not the knife!

00:03:43.830 --> 00:03:46.080
What kind of knife can shoot beams, you idiot?!

00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:48.820
Then what was the new weapon?

00:03:48.820 --> 00:03:50.520
I can't find it right now.

00:03:51.710 --> 00:03:53.160
You're an idiot too!

00:03:53.160 --> 00:03:54.300
You lost something too!

00:03:54.300 --> 00:03:56.560
No, I haven't lost it!

00:03:56.560 --> 00:03:59.380
I just put it somewhere I don't know.

00:04:00.690 --> 00:04:03.210
You won't even admit you've lost it?

00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:07.410
On that note, I have to look for it, so don't bother me anymore.

00:04:07.860 --> 00:04:09.120
Aw...

00:04:09.120 --> 00:04:13.960
Then how about we both look for each others' as well?

00:04:13.960 --> 00:04:18.110
You don't even remember what yours is...

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:19.340
Well...

00:04:19.710 --> 00:04:22.200
Maybe if I give you another good smack...

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.900
No! I'll seriously not be able to remember anything!

00:04:25.900 --> 00:04:27.680
Then figure it out.

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:29.560
Understood.

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:32.880
Bits and pieces are coming to mind...

00:04:32.880 --> 00:04:35.660
I think it was really tasty?

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:36.650
It's food?

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:39.510
No, I get the feeling it's not...

00:04:39.510 --> 00:04:41.070
What are you talking about?

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:46.920
Well, pick up anything you think I might have dropped.

00:04:46.920 --> 00:04:49.370
I'll look for yours as well!

00:04:49.370 --> 00:04:50.410
Hey!

00:04:50.870 --> 00:04:55.370
She didn't even ask what mine was...

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:01.230
Huh? What was it?

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:01.950
Oh well.

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:07.360
What was in this again?

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:11.300
Here! Is this what you lost?

00:05:11.300 --> 00:05:13.720
You just picked up the first thing you came across didn't you?

00:05:13.720 --> 00:05:17.450
Did you really think I was looking for something like this?

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:20.440
I thought this stick might be able to shoot beams...

00:05:20.520 --> 00:05:22.850
Well, I brought something back at least.

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:23.820
What about you?

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:25.620
I found some money.

00:05:26.350 --> 00:05:28.620
Another piece of my memory is returning...

00:05:28.620 --> 00:05:30.530
It was rectangular and thin...

00:05:30.530 --> 00:05:31.670
She's so obvious...

00:05:31.670 --> 00:05:32.950
That must be it!

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:35.180
That must be why my purse is empty!

00:05:35.180 --> 00:05:36.310
It was always empty!

00:05:36.310 --> 00:05:37.640
Excuse me!

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:41.150
Have you seen some money on the floor around here?

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:45.410
Do you mean this?

00:05:45.410 --> 00:05:47.850
Thank you so much!

00:05:47.850 --> 00:05:50.090
I'm glad you came for it.

00:05:50.090 --> 00:05:52.650
That person over there was about to run off with it!

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:53.970
I can hear you.

00:05:53.970 --> 00:05:56.420
I'm just joking!

00:05:56.420 --> 00:05:58.780
Well I'm glad that's sorted out!

00:05:58.780 --> 00:06:00.920
I found mine.

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:03.120
It's a mini stun gun.

00:06:03.720 --> 00:06:05.110
Good for you.

00:06:05.110 --> 00:06:06.590
What about mine?

00:06:06.590 --> 00:06:07.400
Huh?

00:06:07.610 --> 00:06:09.650
What do you mean "huh"?!

00:06:09.650 --> 00:06:12.150
We were supposed to look for each others', right?!

00:06:12.150 --> 00:06:15.310
Don't tell me you forgot that too?

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.480
That electric shock totally helped me remember!

00:06:22.480 --> 00:06:23.090
Really?

00:06:23.840 --> 00:06:27.800
It was a points card that offered free gifts when you collected enough!

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:31.110
I had enough to get a free 5kg of Triple-A Yonezawa beef!

00:06:31.110 --> 00:06:33.100
Why were you walking around with that?

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:35.490
To show it off, of course!

00:06:36.310 --> 00:06:38.610
And now I really should go find it...

00:06:39.300 --> 00:06:40.850
Hey, you dropped something.

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.670
This is it!

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.330
Look, Sonya-chan!

00:06:49.330 --> 00:06:51.180
Meat! Awesome, right?

00:06:51.180 --> 00:06:52.970
I'm getting this for free!

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:54.600
Don't you want some?

00:06:54.600 --> 00:06:55.960
Look, look!

00:06:55.960 --> 00:06:57.170
Stop that, idiot.

00:06:58.590 --> 00:06:59.660
Huh?

00:06:59.910 --> 00:07:01.930
This is past the deadline.

00:07:10.610 --> 00:07:11.960
Shut up.

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:15.630
Another day.

00:07:18.160 --> 00:07:19.560
Sonya-chan!

00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:20.480
Look at this!

00:07:21.220 --> 00:07:23.690
What's with that flat snake?

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:26.630
It's a mythical snake called Tsuchinoko.

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:29.840
Apparently it's been spotted in the mountain near our school!

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:30.690
Oh?

00:07:30.690 --> 00:07:33.030
There's a reward if you can catch it!

00:07:33.030 --> 00:07:34.700
This is a great chance!

00:07:36.210 --> 00:07:38.160
Running ahead isn't fair!

00:07:38.940 --> 00:07:40.690
I'm going home, you idiot!

00:07:45.570 --> 00:07:48.030
I thought you were all excited over it!

00:07:48.030 --> 00:07:49.340
Like hell I am!

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:51.340
Come on, let's go!

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:54.210
I brought equipment for you too!

00:07:54.210 --> 00:07:55.640
Where do you get this stuff...

00:07:56.380 --> 00:07:58.970
Were you going to use this to catch it?

00:07:58.970 --> 00:08:04.050
No. If we can't find the Tsuchinoko, I was going to use that on any old snake and...

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:05.310
Just kidding!

00:08:05.310 --> 00:08:06.660
I wouldn't do that!

00:08:06.660 --> 00:08:08.980
That's just for the off chance we need to use it.

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:11.050
What's that supposed to mean?

00:08:11.050 --> 00:08:13.760
Anyway, there's no way it exists.

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:15.040
It's a waste of time looking.

00:08:15.040 --> 00:08:18.270
B-But lots of people have seen it!

00:08:18.270 --> 00:08:20.220
They're all just mistaken or lying.

00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:24.100
Refusing to believe anything against your preconceived notions...

00:08:24.100 --> 00:08:26.200
Sonya-chan, you're an unbeliever!

00:08:26.200 --> 00:08:30.260
The Tsuchinoko will only appear before those who believe!

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:33.590
Then I guess it won't appear if I'm around, so go by yourself.

00:08:33.590 --> 00:08:35.960
I bet you just don't want to go!

00:08:35.960 --> 00:08:38.160
What if there really is a Tsuchinoko?

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:41.620
If it does exist, I'll dance with it for you.

00:08:41.620 --> 00:08:42.770
You said it!

00:08:42.770 --> 00:08:44.560
It's a promise!

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:49.570
You'll wear a headscarf and dance with a basket while eating pirozhki!

00:08:49.860 --> 00:08:51.420
I didn't say that.

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:52.870
Boo! Boo!

00:08:52.870 --> 00:08:55.970
Well, have fun. If you catch it, let me know.

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:57.910
Wait, she's really going home?

00:08:59.160 --> 00:09:01.860
Wait, she's going to take a detour and try to surprise me, isn't she?

00:09:02.220 --> 00:09:05.390
That Sonya-chan, not honest at all.

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:12.660
Sonya-chan...

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:15.390
You can come out now...

00:09:15.390 --> 00:09:17.760
Why aren't you here?

00:09:27.730 --> 00:09:30.110
She's just making more stuff up.

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:37.610
Look! It's so pretty!

00:09:42.270 --> 00:09:44.270
What are you doing?

00:09:44.270 --> 00:09:45.510
It got away!

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:48.610
You deliberately sent a misleading message!

00:09:48.610 --> 00:09:49.600
I'm going back.

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:52.010
Wait!

00:09:52.010 --> 00:09:54.010
I laid a trap there—

00:09:55.850 --> 00:09:57.260
You damn...

00:09:58.020 --> 00:10:00.180
Want me to help?

00:10:00.180 --> 00:10:01.470
Shut up!

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:03.120
Damn it!

00:10:06.010 --> 00:10:08.190
Something's there...

00:10:08.190 --> 00:10:09.860
Sonya-chan...

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:12.090
It can't really be the Tsuchinoko...

00:10:15.570 --> 00:10:17.200
It's just a snake.

00:10:17.200 --> 00:10:19.300
I think that's a pit viper.

00:10:19.690 --> 00:10:21.410
Oh...

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:23.610
Like I said, the Tsuchinoko doesn't exi—

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:26.500
Pit... viper?

00:10:26.500 --> 00:10:28.820
Poisonous snake!!

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:31.280
Lick.

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.460
That shocked me...

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:37.410
Geez. I hope that's enough for you.

00:10:37.410 --> 00:10:38.740
I'm going home.

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:40.210
Wait!

00:10:40.210 --> 00:10:41.090
Sonya-chan!

00:10:43.950 --> 00:10:46.010
Ow!!

00:10:46.010 --> 00:10:47.900
Ow!

00:10:50.200 --> 00:10:51.510
It's the Tsuchinoko!

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:55.300
You little...

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.420
Why do you know my name?

00:10:57.840 --> 00:11:00.660
I am The Tsuchinoko.

00:11:00.660 --> 00:11:03.370
I'm an assassin who was sent to kill you!

00:11:03.940 --> 00:11:06.700
I've been waiting for a chance these past few days,

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:09.200
but now that you're here, it's perfect!

00:11:09.810 --> 00:11:13.080
Yay! Reward money!

00:11:14.580 --> 00:11:18.970
The world will be shocked when it hears that the Tsuchinoko speaks Japanese!

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:21.010
I have to announce this to the academic world!

00:11:21.490 --> 00:11:22.720
You moron!

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:24.250
He said he's an assassin!

00:11:24.250 --> 00:11:26.720
But he said he's the Tsuchinoko...

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:27.740
Use your eyes!

00:11:27.740 --> 00:11:30.040
He's clearly a human!

00:11:30.040 --> 00:11:32.820
Wow, it can act like humans!

00:11:32.820 --> 00:11:35.540
It must have strong intelligence and mimickry skills...

00:11:36.340 --> 00:11:37.820
Enough!

00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:44.250
Wait, don't tell me he's not actually the Tsuchinoko?!

00:11:44.250 --> 00:11:45.870
You finally noticed?

00:11:45.870 --> 00:11:48.870
You can blabber all you want, but I'm coming!

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:52.610
Watch out, Sonya-chan!

00:11:52.610 --> 00:11:53.460
The pit viper...

00:11:53.460 --> 00:11:54.370
Woah!

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:59.050
You're annoying me, so I'm going to deal with you first.

00:12:01.110 --> 00:12:02.320
Stop!

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:04.010
What?

00:12:04.010 --> 00:12:05.580
A trap?!

00:12:12.910 --> 00:12:15.190
You got him?

00:12:16.450 --> 00:12:19.740
Clearly due to my flawlessly engineered strategy.

00:12:19.740 --> 00:12:21.490
It was totally a coincidence.

00:12:22.420 --> 00:12:24.110
Though I guess in the end...

00:12:25.000 --> 00:12:27.960
It looks like all assassins really are idiots.

00:12:27.960 --> 00:12:29.180
Hey!

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:43.370
Besides, there's no way there'd be a mythical snake here.

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:45.350
You're one to talk...

00:12:45.350 --> 00:12:46.840
Sonya-chan, look!

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:52.620
I know! Since we're here, let's go fishing!

00:12:53.110 --> 00:12:54.170
Here.

00:12:54.170 --> 00:12:57.010
Where were you keeping those?

00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:58.710
Fishing's getting popular recently.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:12:59.770
Didn't you know?

00:12:59.770 --> 00:13:02.990
I'm busy, so you'll have to do it yourself.

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:05.060
But fishing is really fun!

00:13:05.060 --> 00:13:07.540
If you just go home, you'll miss out on this life chance!

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:08.640
Are you really okay with that?

00:13:10.920 --> 00:13:13.750
You just don't want to because you suck at it.

00:13:15.110 --> 00:13:17.120
I'm good at pulling things up.

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:23.860
Fine. You're allowed to watch then.

00:13:23.860 --> 00:13:25.380
Who do you think you are?

00:13:26.220 --> 00:13:30.360
If you watch, I'm sure you'll want to try too.

00:13:30.360 --> 00:13:31.810
One, two...!

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:39.490
Why did you have to hit me?

00:13:39.490 --> 00:13:40.460
I didn't.

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:41.740
Sheesh.

00:13:43.090 --> 00:13:45.070
Hey, shouldn't you use bait?

00:13:45.070 --> 00:13:46.740
Oh, right.

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:49.700
<i>5 yen.</i>

00:13:49.700 --> 00:13:51.010
Hey. Hey.

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:51.790
Come on.

00:13:51.790 --> 00:13:54.270
Do you think you can use that as a bait on me?

00:13:55.060 --> 00:13:56.710
So this is no good...

00:14:02.990 --> 00:14:04.310
Stop screwing around!

00:14:04.310 --> 00:14:06.000
I'll kill you!

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:08.720
But this is normal for fishing.

00:14:08.720 --> 00:14:10.430
Oh, really?

00:14:10.860 --> 00:14:12.880
Where should I cast it?

00:14:14.170 --> 00:14:15.750
Here I go!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:17.880
W-Wait!

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:18.940
Give it to me!

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:20.710
I'll cast it for you.

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:31.010
I got a bite.

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:32.710
Reel it in!

00:14:35.610 --> 00:14:38.210
Oh, it got away.

00:14:38.210 --> 00:14:40.370
Damn! I should have had that!

00:14:40.760 --> 00:14:41.930
One more time.

00:14:43.470 --> 00:14:45.710
<i>I got her good.</i>

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:50.090
I got one!

00:14:52.320 --> 00:14:54.670
That glove looks exactly like a fish!

00:14:54.670 --> 00:14:55.810
Damn it!

00:14:55.810 --> 00:14:57.280
I got one!

00:15:01.910 --> 00:15:05.260
Well well, isn't that just a turtle?

00:15:05.260 --> 00:15:09.400
Turtle's give a great score, because they're rare!

00:15:09.400 --> 00:15:10.950
What the hell do you mean "score"?

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:14.780
Alright, let's have a competition to see who can catch a fish first!

00:15:14.780 --> 00:15:15.780
Fine.

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:24.430
I'm not getting anything...

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:25.100
Damn it!

00:15:25.100 --> 00:15:27.080
At this rate, I'll lose!

00:15:28.060 --> 00:15:30.580
Maybe I'll get a bite if I use a weird pose?

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:34.930
Did you get one?

00:15:35.920 --> 00:15:37.440
I got a leg cramp!

00:15:39.960 --> 00:15:41.750
<i>I'm not getting anything.</i>

00:15:41.750 --> 00:15:44.170
<i>I don't even sense any fish here.</i>

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:45.900
There!

00:15:46.620 --> 00:15:50.400
Hey! Don't cast off so close! The fish are gonna swim away!

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:54.510
I got something!

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:02.470
Why did she just jump off like that?

00:16:03.350 --> 00:16:04.600
You little...!

00:16:04.600 --> 00:16:05.920
Damn it.

00:16:05.920 --> 00:16:07.480
The bottom is all slippery!

00:16:07.480 --> 00:16:09.880
It's because you're acting crazy.

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:11.780
Sheesh.

00:16:16.340 --> 00:16:17.680
When I get up, you're dea—

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:19.020
Catch and release!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:26.910
That's a flexible fishing pole!

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:28.660
It hurts so much!

00:16:31.020 --> 00:16:34.330
Geez... Nothing good ever happens when I'm with her.

00:16:35.260 --> 00:16:37.150
The paper with my orders on it is gone!

00:16:39.190 --> 00:16:42.360
I bet I lost it when I fell in.

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:43.530
Hey! Find it!

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:44.920
You're not going home till it's found!

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:48.980
Damn it. Another fish.

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:50.090
It's not my orders!

00:16:50.090 --> 00:16:52.140
I got another fish too!

00:16:57.870 --> 00:16:58.820
Oh?

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:04.580
Here.

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.160
Morning.

00:17:10.750 --> 00:17:13.000
Isn't there anything interesting?

00:17:15.200 --> 00:17:16.520
Someone dropped a coin!

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:19.700
Watch out!

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:27.120
That's where it fell from?

00:17:27.120 --> 00:17:28.840
You're pretty lucky.

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:30.420
No, I'm not!

00:17:30.420 --> 00:17:33.380
Look! It's just a bottle cap!

00:17:33.970 --> 00:17:36.360
You're worried about that?

00:17:37.110 --> 00:17:38.250
What's this?

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:40.300
Wait, you just noticed?

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:42.640
It barely missed me...

00:17:42.640 --> 00:17:45.860
Maybe I have a lot of luck today?

00:17:45.860 --> 00:17:49.260
If you were really lucky, you wouldn't have been almost killed.

00:17:49.260 --> 00:17:51.650
No, no! It's amazing luck!

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:52.940
You would always hit me, Sonya-chan,

00:17:52.940 --> 00:17:56.580
but I'm not retarded yet because I'm lucky and you're not hitting anywhere damaging!

00:17:59.150 --> 00:18:03.090
Isn't there some way to prove my luck?

00:18:03.090 --> 00:18:04.040
I know!

00:18:04.510 --> 00:18:06.300
Hey, let's play a game.

00:18:06.300 --> 00:18:07.320
Why?

00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:09.870
With a game, I'll be able to show you just how lucky I am.

00:18:09.870 --> 00:18:11.270
Anything's fine.

00:18:11.270 --> 00:18:12.410
How about chess?

00:18:13.260 --> 00:18:15.550
I can't use luck with that...

00:18:15.910 --> 00:18:18.800
Oh, I know! What about Russian Roulette?

00:18:19.100 --> 00:18:21.060
I don't have a revolver.

00:18:21.060 --> 00:18:23.160
That's fine. Just a sec.

00:18:25.950 --> 00:18:28.480
I made a gun out of chopsticks!

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:30.590
Here, you go first.

00:18:32.450 --> 00:18:35.970
You're supposed to aim at yourself in Russian Roulette...

00:18:35.970 --> 00:18:38.450
It doesn't revolve, and it only has one shot.

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:40.520
Then this.

00:18:40.520 --> 00:18:43.870
Coincidentally, my lunch today is three onigiri.

00:18:43.870 --> 00:18:46.870
But one of these is different...

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:48.500
Is it spicy?

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:50.240
Nope. It's really good.

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:52.700
It's good? Then that's not bad, right?

00:18:52.700 --> 00:18:55.130
But it's something you eat yourself.

00:18:55.130 --> 00:18:56.550
But there's three.

00:18:56.550 --> 00:18:59.410
Isn't it more interesting with three people?

00:18:59.410 --> 00:19:01.520
You needn't worry about that!

00:19:01.520 --> 00:19:02.530
Because...

00:19:02.950 --> 00:19:05.370
I'm here!

00:19:06.880 --> 00:19:08.010
Ta-da!

00:19:08.660 --> 00:19:10.380
H-Huh?

00:19:10.380 --> 00:19:11.230
What the heck?

00:19:11.660 --> 00:19:14.370
I had a feeling you called me.

00:19:14.370 --> 00:19:16.230
Well, we didn't really...

00:19:16.230 --> 00:19:18.600
Whatever. Let's just eat.

00:19:20.520 --> 00:19:22.570
It's good.

00:19:22.570 --> 00:19:23.590
Yeah.

00:19:23.590 --> 00:19:25.040
It was!

00:19:27.700 --> 00:19:30.920
Different people have different tastes!

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:33.670
That's true, but...

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:36.960
By the way, what's going on today?

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:39.330
She wants to show us how lucky she is.

00:19:39.800 --> 00:19:42.720
Then let's all do this.

00:19:42.720 --> 00:19:45.300
"The Black Ninja's Close Call."

00:19:45.300 --> 00:19:48.150
Ooh! It's the perfect toy!

00:19:48.150 --> 00:19:51.130
Alright, I'll start it off.

00:19:57.380 --> 00:19:58.500
Strong!

00:19:59.560 --> 00:20:02.580
That's not how I thought you're supposed to play it!

00:20:02.580 --> 00:20:03.530
Now, now.

00:20:03.530 --> 00:20:06.000
He just had very bad luck.

00:20:06.000 --> 00:20:08.370
That was just the side show.

00:20:08.370 --> 00:20:10.900
This is the real one!

00:20:10.900 --> 00:20:12.770
"Person Biter One."

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:15.560
We take turns putting our hand in its mouth,

00:20:15.560 --> 00:20:17.850
and he'll randomly bite down.

00:20:17.850 --> 00:20:20.270
The price is 1,280 yen with tax.

00:20:20.270 --> 00:20:23.530
Ninjas these days are making a living off selling toys?

00:20:23.530 --> 00:20:24.770
Sounds good!

00:20:24.770 --> 00:20:26.550
Now I'll prove how lucky I am!

00:20:29.340 --> 00:20:32.020
He bit down at my first try...

00:20:32.020 --> 00:20:33.640
I knew I had good luck!

00:20:33.640 --> 00:20:36.820
No, that would be you losing.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:40.110
On the way home.

00:20:41.810 --> 00:20:45.260
Knowing that I have no good luck has made me very uneasy.

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:46.740
You finally realized it?

00:20:46.740 --> 00:20:49.970
I'll buy some juice to cheer up.

00:20:53.560 --> 00:20:55.330
Congratulations!

00:20:55.330 --> 00:20:56.840
Congratulations!

00:20:56.840 --> 00:20:57.790
I did it!

00:20:57.790 --> 00:21:00.420
My legendary good luck was the real thing!

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:04.780
...or so I thought, but both of these aren't what I pushed.

00:21:04.780 --> 00:21:06.890
You're hopeless.

00:21:09.610 --> 00:21:16.440
My guesses are wrong in tests and I miss the date for points cards because I'm unlucky...

00:21:16.440 --> 00:21:18.400
That's just because you're stupid.

00:21:19.660 --> 00:21:21.040
It has nothing to do with luck.

00:21:21.710 --> 00:21:24.240
Are you trying to comfort me?

00:21:24.240 --> 00:21:26.770
Not really, I'm just stating the truth.

00:21:28.410 --> 00:21:30.280
Thanks, Sonya-chan!

00:21:30.280 --> 00:21:32.980
Alright, I'm feeling great!

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:54.770
I knew I was unlucky!

00:21:55.130 --> 00:21:56.040
Damn it!

00:21:56.040 --> 00:21:57.390
Why me?!

00:22:03.070 --> 00:22:06.460
Fishing, Tsuchinoko, Lost Twig.

00:22:06.460 --> 00:22:09.050
Ah! Sonya-chan!
